  "body": "Creating this issue mostly so if it happens again, we can see if there is a pattern:\n\nFor 7.5 minutes starting at 18:38 UTC on 2019-01-10, one of the event creator workers on matrix.org was completely unresponsive, with 100% cpu usage and no log output.\n\nA `POST /_matrix/client/r0/rooms/{room}/send/m.room.message/{txnId}` request claimed 446 seconds of CPU time. \n\nOther processes seemed unaffected.",
